# ne-report.timer — run ne-report.service daily at 00:00 Europe/Vienna, 4 h after the 20:00 contrib prewarm (srv/contrib.go contribWarmHour/contribNightHour) filled the RAM stash; ~380 KGs × ~27 s ≈ 2.8 h at CPUQuota 100 % → settled before 03:30, no CPU spike during the day.
[Unit]
Description=Daily NE epoch reports (siedler → umfeld-at)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 00:00:00 Europe/Vienna
RandomizedDelaySec=15min
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
